  "pitch": "Mono-Red Robot Aggro with a poison overdrive. Seventeen of 24 nonland cards are nontoken artifact creatures, and they kill through 20 life on their own off 16 untapped Mountains with zero fixing cost. Virulent Silencer is the overdrive: when drawn, every one of those same attacks also adds two poison counters -- four with both copies -- collapsing a five-attack clock to two or three. The defining limitation is stated up front rather than buried: mono-red contains NO tutor able to find a 3-mana artifact, so Silencer is a hard 2-of that appears in only about half of games (p=0.487 by turn 6, p=0.537 by turn 8). Weapons Manufacturing converts the deck's artifact density into repeatable removal, which is the only substitute mono-red has for the evasion it lacks.",
